// AFK managed work-item lifecycle
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
wrap on

"输入与执行权" [color: "#EAF5F2"] {
  Provider_Backlog [label: "Provider Backlog\nReady / Rework", icon: github, color: "#27877A"]
  Eligibility [label: "Eligibility + Dependency Checks", icon: list-checks, color: "#3977C8"]
  Manifest [label: "Manifest / Project Validation", icon: file-check, color: "#3977C8"]
  Claim [label: "Claim Lease + Execution ID", icon: lock, color: "#3977C8"]
}

"实现阶段" [color: "#EAF1FC"] {
  Prepare_Workspace [label: "Branch / Worktree / Sandbox", icon: folders, color: "#64748B"]
  Workflow_Runner [label: "WorkflowRunner + Template", icon: workflow, color: "#3977C8"]
  Plan_Executor [label: "PlanExecutor", icon: list-tree, color: "#3977C8"]
  Agent [label: "Agent Provider Process", icon: bot, color: "#8060B5"]
  Verification [label: "Implementation Published\nState: verification", icon: git-branch, color: "#3977C8"]
}

"独立验证与发布" [color: "#FFF5E8"] {
  QA [label: "Independent QARunner", icon: shield-check, color: "#C58A38"]
  QA_Pass [label: "QA PASS", icon: check-circle, color: "#27877A"]
  QA_Fail [label: "QA FAIL", icon: x-circle, color: "#C85C5C"]
  Change_Request [label: "Create / Verify PR or MR", icon: git-pull-request, color: "#3977C8"]
  Merge_Ready [label: "merge_ready + HITL", icon: user-check, color: "#C58A38"]
  Human_Merge [label: "Human Review + Merge", icon: users, color: "#C58A38"]
  Done [label: "Verified Merge → done", icon: check-check, color: "#27877A"]
  Rework [label: "Bounded Rework", icon: repeat, color: "#C58A38"]
  Blocked [label: "blocked + HITL", icon: alert-triangle, color: "#C85C5C"]
}

Provider_Backlog > Eligibility
Eligibility > Manifest: runnable
Eligibility > Blocked: not runnable
Manifest > Claim: valid
Manifest > Blocked: mismatch
Claim > Prepare_Workspace: lease granted
Prepare_Workspace > Workflow_Runner
Workflow_Runner > Plan_Executor
Plan_Executor > Agent
Agent > Verification: branch pushed
Agent > Blocked: failure / timeout
Verification > QA: executeWorkItem continues
QA > QA_Pass: independent checks pass
QA > QA_Fail: checks fail
QA_Pass > Change_Request
Change_Request > Merge_Ready: change verified
Merge_Ready > Human_Merge
Human_Merge > Done: merge audited
QA_Fail > Rework: attempts remain
Rework > Prepare_Workspace: next bounded attempt
QA_Fail > Blocked: retry limit reached

"独立入口语义" [color: "#F1F4F8"] {
  Run_Command [label: "afk run", icon: terminal, color: "#3977C8"]
  Execute_Command [label: "afk execute", icon: terminal, color: "#27877A"]
  Loop_Command [label: "afk loop", icon: repeat, color: "#8060B5"]
  Loop_Scope [label: "Exactly one Manifest-bound Work Item", icon: file-check, color: "#64748B"]
}

Run_Command --> Workflow_Runner: implementation stage
Execute_Command --> Claim: managed lifecycle
Loop_Command > Loop_Scope
Loop_Scope --> Eligibility: re-poll same item

legend [position: bottom] {
  [connection: ">", label: "Synchronous execution / control"]
  [connection: "-->", label: "Entry point or supporting relationship"]
  [color: "#C85C5C", label: "Blocked / failure"]
  [color: "#C58A38", label: "Human gate / bounded retry"]
}